            <div xml:id="d111-a2">

                <pb facs="0318" n="298" sameAs="frus:frus1946v02/pg298"/>

                <p>[In a letter dated May 7, 1946, President Truman answered Austrian President
                    Renner’s letter of February 6, 1946, regarding Austria, Europe, and the South
                    Tyrol. The text of President Truman’s letter is included in telegram 467, May 9,
                    1946, to Vienna, repeated to Paris as 2210, Secdel 218, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1946v05/pg_340">Volume V, page 340</ref>.]</p>
            </div>
